● Total damage = physical damage + magic damage
{(Magic Attack * Magic Attack Up Magnification * Magic Attack Down Magnification)-(Magic Defense / 2 * Magic Defense Up Magnification * Magic Defense Down Magnification)} * Magic Attack Skill Magnification + Random Number (0-3)
