About action order The action order is determined by calculating the action value using the status agility value.
If there is a unit with an action value of 1000 or more at the same time, the unit with the higher action value will act first. If the values are exactly the same, the unit with the higher total status will act first.
Acting activates skills or normal attacks. Skills are activated in the order determined at the time of formation.
