Why are micro brushless DC motors & micro brushed DC motors so easy to control?
In the application of motor, micro brushless DC motors & micro brushed DC motors are very easy to control, why so?
The speed control of the micro brushless DC motors & micro brushed DC motors can be understood as the control torque. The torque of the small brushless DC motors & small brushed DC motors are proportional to the current, so the current change in the armature current can smoothly adjust the speed control, and the effect is good and simple.Ac motor is a multivariable strong coupling system, so to control the need for frequency conversion, that is, vector control.
